206 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (skills that job seekers possess. Employability and skills mismatch manifests due to various factors - Rapid technological advancements often outpace workforce skill development, leading to a mismatch between demanded and possessed skills. Inadequacies within educational systems, such as outdated curricula and a theoretical focus over practical skills, further worsen this disparity. Evolving job requirements, influenced by technological shifts and globalization, intensify skill demands, while demographic changes alter skill demands within industries or regions. These dynamics collectively challenge the alignment of workforce skills with job market demands. \(Thorn, 2023\))
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
