225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Recent graduates perceive a gap between their academic accomplishments and the real-world abilities needed in the workplace. Although they are ready to study and develop, they don't feel ready or supported when they go from school to the workforce. The emotional toll includes feelings of inadequacy, stress, and uncertainty about their career paths.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
