/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (TechCorp, a leading technology company, implemented a comprehensive initiative called "TechSkills" to address skills mismatches and align with stakeholder needs, socio-economic issues, and data-driven solutions. This initiative included skills-based job descriptions, structured interview questions, personal development plans, educational reforms, skills assessments, and gender-specific support.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
