366 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In conclusion, addressing the issue of employability and skills mismatch necessitates a comprehensive strategy that resonates with the needs and emotions of all involved parties. Throughout this report, we've explored the multifaceted nature of this challenge, acknowledging its wide-ranging impact on individuals, businesses, and economies.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
367 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (By considering the insights gathered from the empathy map, we've gained a deeper understanding of the frustration and uncertainty experienced by job seekers, particularly recent graduates, as they navigate the gap between academic learning and practical application. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
